#: ../../navigation.rst:2
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "导航"

#: ../../navigation.rst:4
msgid ""
"Search a gene or an exact interval, then choose how much detail to "
"display. Coordinates typed into Orbit are **1-based, inclusive**. The "
"examples below use **human hg38 / GRCh38**; do not reuse them on hg19."
msgstr ""
"搜索基因或精确区间，然后选择要显示的详细程度。在 Orbit 中输入的坐标采用 从 1 开始且包含首尾 的格式。下面示例使用 人类 hg38 / "
"GRCh38 ；请勿在 hg19 上复用这些坐标。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:9
msgid "Search and zoom"
msgstr "搜索与缩放"

#: ../../navigation.rst:11
msgid "Select **hg38** in the assembly menu."
msgstr "在装配菜单中选择  hg38 。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:12
msgid ""
"Type ``EGFR`` and press :kbd:`Enter` to open the gene. Select a "
"suggestion when several names match; entering the same text again is not "
"a next-hit command."
msgstr "输入 ``EGFR`` 并按  :kbd:`Enter`  打开该基因。如果有多个名称匹配，请选择建议项；再次输入相同文本不会跳转到下一个匹配项。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:14
msgid "Paste ``chr7:55,019,250-55,019,308`` to inspect its start-codon region."
msgstr "粘贴 ``chr7:55,019,250-55,019,308`` 查看其起始密码子区域。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:15
msgid ""
"Use the wheel or toolbar zoom controls to change scale. Drag a track to "
"pan; dragging is not an interval-selection gesture. Double-click to zoom "
"in around the pointer. :kbd:`/` focuses the search box."
msgstr "使用滚轮或工具栏缩放控件调整比例。拖动轨道可平移；拖动不是选择区间的操作。双击可围绕指针放大。 :kbd:`/`  聚焦搜索框。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:19
msgid ""
"The search also accepts ``chr7``, ``chr7:55,019,278``, and coordinate "
"ranges without thousands separators. Zooming below one base per pixel is "
"supported; this is necessary to make individual base letters readable. "
"See :doc:`sequence` for nucleotide and amino-acid views."
msgstr ""
"搜索还接受 ``chr7``、``chr7:55,019,278`` "
"以及不带千位分隔符的坐标范围。支持缩放到每像素少于一个碱基，这是读清单个碱基字母所必需的。有关核苷酸和氨基酸视图，请参阅  "
":doc:`sequence` 。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:24
msgid "ACTB locus showing the toolbar, track labels and gene model"
msgstr "显示工具栏、轨道标签和基因模型的 ACTB 位点"

#: ../../navigation.rst:28
msgid ""
"A complete locus view. The assembly and search controls are at the top; "
"track settings are beside the drawing, and the sidebar holds visibility "
"switches and the selected-gene details."
msgstr "完整的位点视图。顶部是装配和搜索控件；绘图旁是轨道设置，侧边栏包含可见性开关和所选基因的详细信息。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:33
msgid "Expand and collapse a gene"
msgstr "展开和折叠基因"

#: ../../navigation.rst:35
msgid ""
"Search ``EGFR``. In the RefSeq drawing, find the small **+** beside its "
"label. Clicking the gene body or name selects it; it does not by itself "
"expand it."
msgstr "搜索 ``EGFR``。在 RefSeq 绘图中找到标签旁的小  + 。点击基因主体或名称会选中它，但不会因此展开。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:37
msgid ""
"Click **+** to show the individual transcript rows. The symbol becomes "
"**−**."
msgstr "点击  +  显示各条转录本行。该符号会变为  − 。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:38
msgid ""
"Compare transcript accessions (for example ``NM_005228``), exon blocks, "
"intron connectors and coding regions. Different isoforms can have "
"different exon structures and CDS boundaries."
msgstr "比较转录本登录号（例如 ``NM_005228``）、外显子块、内含子连接线和编码区域。不同异构体可能具有不同的外显子结构和 CDS 边界。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:41
msgid ""
"Click **−** in the same place to collapse the transcript rows back to the"
" merged gene model. A gene with only one transcript has no +/− expansion "
"control."
msgstr "在同一位置点击  − ，将转录本行折叠回合并的基因模型。只有一条转录本的基因没有 +/− 展开控件。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:44
msgid "EGFR collapsed to a merged gene model with its plus control"
msgstr "折叠为合并基因模型并显示加号控件的 EGFR"

#: ../../navigation.rst:48
msgid ""
"Before expansion: one merged EGFR model. Use the small + control, not an "
"arbitrary point on an exon, to open the transcript list."
msgstr "展开前：一个合并的 EGFR 模型。请使用小 + 控件打开转录本列表，不要点击外显子上的任意位置。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:51
msgid "EGFR expanded into separate named transcript rows"
msgstr "展开为独立命名转录本行的 EGFR"

#: ../../navigation.rst:55
msgid ""
"After expansion: EGFR isoforms occupy separate rows with their transcript"
" accessions. The − control collapses them again; the locus and zoom are "
"unchanged."
msgstr "展开后：EGFR 异构体占据独立行，并显示其转录本登录号。− 控件会再次折叠它们；位点和缩放保持不变。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:59
msgid "Expand or collapse the entire track"
msgstr "展开或折叠整个轨道"

#: ../../navigation.rst:61
msgid ""
"Click the **gear beside RefSeq**, then choose **Expand all** or "
"**Collapse all**. Expand all also applies to genes that become visible "
"after panning. You can still collapse an individual gene using its − "
"control. Imported GTF/GFF3 gene tracks have their own gear and "
"independent expansion state. Shift-click is not an expand-all shortcut. "
"Do not rely on expansion surviving a new app launch."
msgstr ""
"点击  RefSeq 旁的齿轮 ，然后选择  Expand all  或  Collapse all 。Expand all "
"也会应用于平移后出现的基因。仍可使用某个基因的 − 控件单独折叠它。导入的 GTF/GFF3 "
"基因轨道有自己的齿轮和独立展开状态。Shift-点击不是“全部展开”快捷方式。不要假定重新启动应用后仍会保留展开状态。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:67
msgid "Gene-track settings with Expand all and Collapse all buttons"
msgstr "包含 Expand all 和 Collapse all 按钮的基因轨道设置"

#: ../../navigation.rst:71
msgid ""
"The actual gene-track settings: expansion controls and colours for "
"strands, CDS and UTR. The setting affects the chosen track, not every "
"annotation file."
msgstr "实际的基因轨道设置：包含链、CDS 和 UTR 的展开控件及颜色。该设置只影响所选轨道，不会影响每个注释文件。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:75
msgid "Compare several genes in panels"
msgstr "在多个面板中比较基因"

#: ../../navigation.rst:77
msgid ""
"Orbit supports **1–5 panels**. Loci and zoom levels are independent; "
"track files and track-level settings are shared. A panel is not a "
"separate sample import."
msgstr "Orbit 支持  1–5 个面板 。各面板的位点和缩放级别相互独立；轨道文件及轨道级设置共享。面板不是独立的样本导入。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:81
msgid "Two-panel example: ACTB and EGFR"
msgstr "双面板示例：ACTB 和 EGFR"

#: ../../navigation.rst:83
msgid "Open **Split view** in the toolbar and choose **2 panels**."
msgstr "在工具栏打开  Split view ，选择  2 panels 。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:84
msgid ""
"In the position input above the first panel, type ``ACTB`` and press "
"Enter."
msgstr "在第一个面板上方的位置输入框中输入 ``ACTB`` 并按 Enter。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:85
msgid "In the second panel input, type ``EGFR`` and press Enter."
msgstr "在第二个面板的输入框中输入 ``EGFR`` 并按 Enter。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:86
msgid ""
"Zoom or pan within one panel to compare detail without moving the other. "
"Click its header to select the target panel for shared toolbar "
"navigation."
msgstr "在一个面板中缩放或平移以比较细节，不会移动另一个面板。点击其标题可选择目标面板，供共享工具栏导航使用。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:88
msgid ""
"Use the **×** in a panel header to close that panel, or choose one panel "
"in the split menu to return to a single view."
msgstr "点击面板标题中的  ×  关闭该面板，或在分屏菜单中选择单个面板返回单视图。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:91
msgid "ACTB and EGFR displayed in two independent genomic panels"
msgstr "在两个独立基因组面板中显示的 ACTB 和 EGFR"

#: ../../navigation.rst:95
msgid ""
"ACTB (negative strand) and EGFR (positive strand) in two panels. Each has"
" its own position field and coordinate scale: aligned screen columns do "
"not mean the same genomic coordinate."
msgstr "两个面板中的 ACTB（负链）和 EGFR（正链）。每个面板都有自己的位置输入框和坐标比例：屏幕上对齐的列不表示相同的基因组坐标。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:100
msgid "Four-panel example"
msgstr "四面板示例"

#: ../../navigation.rst:102
msgid ""
"Choose **4 panels**, then enter ``ACTB``, ``EGFR``, ``TP53`` and ``MYC`` "
"in their respective header inputs. Alternatively, enter ``ACTB, EGFR, "
"TP53, MYC`` in the main search box to open multiple loci. Check the pane "
"count and gene names before exporting. Ctrl+number is not a supported "
"panel-focus shortcut."
msgstr ""
"选择  4 panels ，然后在相应标题输入框中输入 ``ACTB``、``EGFR``、``TP53`` 和 "
"``MYC``。也可以在主搜索框中输入 ``ACTB, EGFR, TP53, MYC`` "
"以打开多个位点。导出前检查面板数量和基因名称。Ctrl+数字不是受支持的面板聚焦快捷键。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:107
msgid "Four panels comparing ACTB EGFR TP53 and MYC"
msgstr "比较 ACTB、EGFR、TP53 和 MYC 的四个面板"

#: ../../navigation.rst:111
msgid ""
"Four real gene loci side by side. The view makes gene structures easy to "
"compare, while every panel retains its own zoom and chromosome."
msgstr "四个真实基因位点并排显示。该视图便于比较基因结构，同时每个面板保留自己的缩放和染色体。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:115
msgid "Whole-genome overview and links"
msgstr "全基因组总览与链接"

#: ../../navigation.rst:117
msgid ""
"Enable the whole-genome overview from the sidebar track list. Its chevron"
" expands the primary-chromosome bars; their count depends on the chosen "
"species. Click a bar to navigate. In split view each panel draws its own "
"overview and current-window marker."
msgstr "在侧边栏轨道列表中启用全基因组总览。点击其箭头可展开主染色体条；条数取决于所选物种。点击某条即可导航。在分屏视图中，每个面板都会绘制自己的总览和当前窗口标记。"

#: ../../navigation.rst:122
msgid "In browser mode a locus can be opened with a URL such as::"
msgstr "在浏览器模式下，可以使用如下 URL 打开位点："

#: ../../navigation.rst:126
msgid ""
"Use the search box inside the native desktop window when no address bar "
"is shown."
msgstr "桌面原生窗口不显示地址栏时，请使用窗口内的搜索框。"

